WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.084 --> 00:00:01.293
- Welcome back.

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:03.779
Before we say goodbye, we
like to play a quick round of-

00:00:03.779 --> 00:00:05.357
- Drewth or Dare.

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:08.357
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.270
All right, Malcolm Minor.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:12.103
Hi.

00:00:12.103 --> 00:00:13.040
- Hi, how you doing?

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.750
- Fantastic, thank you.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:16.060
Is it a Drewth or a dare?

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:16.900
- It's a dare.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:17.810
- Okay, what is it?

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:22.520
- So since it's pasta week,
I dare you, both of you,

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.500
to have a pasta eating contest.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:28.143
No hands so you have
to dive in face first.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:31.523
- So do what I do at home?

00:00:32.995 --> 00:00:35.630
This is why I don't
want sexy music playing.

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.930
- Oh, okay.

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:37.763
Okay. I'm all.

00:00:37.763 --> 00:00:38.840
Are you ready to get messy?

00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:40.340
- Well, I'm excited,

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:43.060
because I don't know what
is gonna happen here.

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:45.030
And I don't, I mean, in all seriousness

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:46.980
I haven't done this.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:47.813
- Oh, okay.

00:00:47.813 --> 00:00:49.890
- Contrary to what you might think.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:51.050
- So no hands

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.550
and we're just gonna,
just get in it, Malcolm?

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.383
- Just go in.

00:00:54.383 --> 00:00:55.490
- [Ross] Okay. Okay.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.110
- Try to protect the wardrobe.

00:00:57.110 --> 00:01:02.060
This is a very well fitted lab coat.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:04.450
This is a contest, Ross,
at the end of the day.

00:01:04.450 --> 00:01:07.430
So you would never pus around with me

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.410
and I'm not doing it with you either,

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:11.420
so it's game time.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.588
- All right, Barrymore. Let's do this.

00:01:13.588 --> 00:01:14.980
(audience cheering)

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:16.360
Oh my God.

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.240
- You're not my bestie right now.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:20.940
- Okay. Game face on and
then face in the pasta.

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:21.963
Oh gosh, she's in.

00:01:24.228 --> 00:01:25.061
Oh my God.

00:01:26.357 --> 00:01:29.357
(audience cheering)

00:01:36.300 --> 00:01:37.683
I got sauce in my nose.

00:01:46.218 --> 00:01:50.301
(audience laughing and cheering)

00:01:56.713 --> 00:02:00.130
Hey, Drew, you got a little, right there.

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:04.970
- Well, Malcolm, is this
what you had in mind?

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:07.193
- Pretty much. (laughing)

00:02:12.580 --> 00:02:15.330
(hosts laughing)

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:22.003
- Well, I have to say Malcolm.

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:26.390
I have never had tomato sauce up my nose.

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.102
- [Ross] Nope. Nope.

00:02:28.102 --> 00:02:29.489
Thank you Malcolm.

00:02:29.489 --> 00:02:30.835
(audience applauds)

00:02:30.835 --> 00:02:31.720
Oh my gosh. Up my nose.

00:02:31.720 --> 00:02:34.420
- I mean literally, totally up my nose.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:36.610
Well, thank you guys.

00:02:36.610 --> 00:02:40.780
And I mean this with all
of my heart and sincerity.

00:02:40.780 --> 00:02:44.090
I'm so glad that you guys
came to visit us today.

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.812
Thank you so much.

00:02:45.812 --> 00:02:47.657
Really and truly.

00:02:47.657 --> 00:02:50.824
(theme music playing)

